> The CSSWG has been discussing an issue (https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12671) that ended up involving this topic too.

I think that's a mistake. These features have dramatically different levels of granularity: mixins can apply styles to a given rule; stylesheets apply styles to an entire scope.
